WEBVTT

00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:02.540
AI is already part of everyday life.

00:00:02.840 --> 00:00:06.380
Even an 80-year-old retiree now asks AI for help.

00:00:08.350 --> 00:00:10.990
But every answer needs enormous computing power.

00:00:11.290 --> 00:00:14.730
That takes GPUs — thousands of calculations at once.

00:00:15.350 --> 00:00:18.610
NVIDIA is a leading supplier of AI chips and systems

00:00:18.910 --> 00:00:20.550
powering today's data centers.

00:00:21.350 --> 00:00:25.010
Quarterly revenue rose from $68.1 billion,

00:00:25.310 --> 00:00:28.620
to $81.6 billion, then $96.2 billion.

00:00:29.350 --> 00:00:32.510
NVIDIA partners across cloud, enterprise and AI,

00:00:32.810 --> 00:00:35.450
and its next earnings report is a key catalyst.

00:00:36.350 --> 00:00:39.440
Picture a scenario: the stock rises from $218

00:00:39.740 --> 00:00:42.640
to $235.44. Up 8%.

00:00:43.350 --> 00:00:48.620
Invest $25,000, and an 8% rise could return $9,975.68.

00:00:48.920 --> 00:00:52.990
Invest $50,000, and it could return $29,996.80.

00:00:53.850 --> 00:00:57.340
Illustrative figures, before costs. Always do your own research.
